    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "stepping out of the crowd... it sounds so poetic, but it feels impossible. it just feels like more work, just another thing to struggle with. i'm just so done with the struggle. i just want it to stop. i want everything to just... stop. is there any way to actually make it stop for good?",
